{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Curse of the Dragonbeast is A turn-based tactical RPG with Team Roguelike Loot - help your team find the best build. Choose from 20+ playable professions, master over 130 unique items, and outsmart your enemies in unpredictable hex-grid battles that reward adaptable strategy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strategic Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5v5 matches on expansive hex-grid maps filled with forests, rivers, bushes and terrain that demand smart positioning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play against challenging AI opponents in Solo or Co-Op.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ playable professions (with more planned), each with roles like Tank, Damage, Control, Support, and Healer. Synergize with your team for victory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a unique build every match.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your match length - 45 min full length matches or 15 min arena matches.\u00a0</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Team Roguelike Loot - Hoard items to win</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share items with your team in a team-owned inventory. Store items for later or give them to teammates for big plays.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield powerful Cursed and Holy items, but use them for too long and you will be consumed by their power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden item interactions that reward outside-the-box thinking.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Replayability</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shapeshifting transformations and ever-changing items ensure no two matches are alike.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five game modes and 10+ maps to keep gameplay varied.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every match is a new puzzle \u2014 experiment, adapt, and surprise your opponents.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extensive future content plans.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PvP coming soon.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABOUT THE DEMO</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo is<strong> single player only</strong>\u00a0for now. This demo is an early version. While fully playable, certain elements are still in development and may not reflect the final release.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We invite you to join our Discord where you may be able to help test multiplayer and shape the game with us.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[]xxxxx[:::::::::::::::::::::::&gt;</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4085730?t=1771943676","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085730/e85e8e2d5496b83023b22c9f62a22d4253af6e7f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771943676","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085730/7d82c69efe9742493ad05186100c849b5e80cba4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771943676","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085730/7d82c69efe9742493ad05186100c849b5e80cba4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771943676","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4104270,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Curse of the Dragonbeast is A turn-based tactical RPG with Team Roguelike Loot - help your team find the best build. Choose from 20+ p